{title: The Heart of Worship (FJ_180_en)}
{subtitle: Nr. 180 · English}
{tempo: 70}
{time: 4/4}
{key: D}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[D]When the music fades, [A]all is stripped away,
[Em7]and I simply come; [A]
[D]longing just to bring [A]something that's of worth
[Em7]that will bless Your [Asus4]heart. [A]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
[Em7]I'll bring You more than a [D/F#]song, [Asus4]for a song in itself
[Em7]is not what You have re[D/F#]quired. [Asus4][A]
[Em7]You search much deeper with[D/F#]in [Asus4]through the way things ap[D/F#]pear;
[Em7]You're looking into my [D/F#]heart. [Asus4][A]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[D]I'm coming back to the heart [A/C#]of worship, and it's
[Em7]all about You, [G]all about You, [Asus4]Jesus.
[D]I'm sorry, Lord, for the thing [A/C#]I've made it, when it's
[Em7]all about You, [G]all about You, [A7sus4]Jesus. [D]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[D]King of endless worth, [A]no one could express
[Em7]how much You deserve. [A]
[D]Though I'm weak and poor, [A]all I have is Yours,
[Em7]ev'ry single breath. [Asus4][A]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
[Em7]I'll bring You more than a [D/F#]song, [Asus4]for a song in itself
[Em7]is not what You have re[D/F#]quired. [Asus4][A]
[Em7]You search much deeper with[D/F#]in [Asus4]through the way things ap[D/F#]pear;
[Em7]You're looking into my [D/F#]heart. [Asus4][A]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[D]I'm coming back to the heart [A/C#]of worship, and it's
[Em7]all about You, [G]all about You, [Asus4]Jesus.
[D]I'm sorry, Lord, for the thing [A/C#]I've made it, when it's
[Em7]all about You, [G]all about You, [A7sus4]Jesus. [D]
{end_of_chorus}

